Homepage: https://github.com/anatolijphp/Thermaltake-TH240-V2-ULTRA-LCD
Description: Screen software for the Thermaltake TH240 V2 Ultra (CL-W383) LCD
 Drives the cooler's round 2.1" LCD without TT RGB Plus: a clock and sensor
 face (coolant temperature from the cooler, CPU temperature and load), an
 image, an animated GIF or a colour. Command-line tool (ttlcd) plus a systemd
 user service (systemctl --user enable --now ttlcd). The window
 (ttlcd-studio) is the separate ttlcd-studio package.
